The tree fog won

22:46.270 --> 22:51.280
Sekai KAERU tobi KONKUURU

22:51.740 --> 22:55.660
The world frog-jumping contest

22:51.740 --> 22:55.660
Yuushou shita yo AMAGAERU

22:58.870 --> 23:05.040
Under the kitten's paw

22:58.870 --> 23:05.040
Koneko chan no ashi no ura wa

23:05.460 --> 23:11.630
Is the scent of the sun, right?

23:05.460 --> 23:11.630
Otentou sama no nioi dane

23:14.470 --> 23:17.800
Paris is sunnier than London

23:14.470 --> 23:17.800
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

23:17.890 --> 23:20.890
Carmen likes paella more than pasta

23:17.890 --> 23:20.890
CARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

23:21.390 --> 23:27.770
It's not the time to hang around

23:21.390 --> 23:27.770
Michikusa shite iru baai ja nai ne

23:28.650 --> 23:33.150
Indeed, indeed

23:28.650 --> 23:33.150
Kitto kitto

23:41.500 --> 23:42.920
Tomorrow's Nadja

23:42.770 --> 23:46.990
﻿In a fogbound Venice at night, a slowly creeping evil plan and a dark shadow...

23:47.610 --> 23:51.820
﻿Tell me, Phantom Thief Black Rose! The truth hidden behind your mask!

23:53.080 --> 23:58.830
﻿By stealing, even if you are helping the poor, someday you will put yourself in danger.

23:59.420 --> 24:02.580
﻿I'm sure there are many good nobles like Francis, too!

24:03.460 --> 24:06.590
Tomorrow's Nadja. A Foggy Night, The Black Rose's Truth.

24:04.610 --> 24:07.070
A Foggy Night - The Black Rose's Truth

24:06.920 --> 24:08.880
﻿Now, the door to destiny opens.
